{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17355","headline":"嘉兴九日寄丹阳亲故 · 权德舆","name":"嘉兴九日寄丹阳亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷年路歧客，西望思茫茫。\n积水曾南渡，浮云失旧乡。\n海边寻别墅，愁里见重阳。\n草露荷衣冷，山风菊酒香。\n独谣看坠叶，远目徧秋光。\n更羡登攀处，烟花满练塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}